        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 76030, 8 Inch Lafayette Basket Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Lafayette 8 Inch Door Handle has an old world basket design that is dripping with rustic charm. This 8 Inch Lafayette Basket Door Handle is made out of wrought steel. Choose from flat black steel or satin steel finishes, both of which have a rough texture to add to the historic feel by imitating the texture of naturally weathered iron. This 8 inch door pull comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-8-inch-lafayette-door-pull-set-emtek-btb-76030\"><b>Lafayette Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Lafayette Wrought Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
